     {
      "type": "TEXT",
      "id": "",
      "nodes": [],
      "textData": {
       "text": "v0.3: the first battle test",
       "decorations": [
        {
         "type": "COLOR",
         "colorData": {
          "foreground": "#13224b"
         }
        }
       ]
      }
     }
    ],
    "headingData": {
     "level": 2
    }
   },
   {
    "type": "PARAGRAPH",
    "id": "",
    "nodes": [],
    "paragraphData": {}
   },
   {
    "type": "PARAGRAPH",
    "id": "",
    "nodes": [
     {
      "type": "TEXT",
      "id": "",
      "nodes": [],
      "textData": {
       "text": "The first battle test put the crew on a grid on a route map. You place them and they act on their own by role. You can see who the foes are targeting, but not how hard. When two crew members stand side by side they can combo, with a close-up where you pick the move. A turn-based boss fight closed the test.",
       "decorations": []
      }
     }
    ],
    "paragraphData": {}
   },
   {
    "type": "PARAGRAPH",
    "id": "",
    "nodes": [],
    "paragraphData": {}
   },
   {
    "type": "PARAGRAPH",
    "id": "",
    "nodes": [
     {
      "type": "TEXT",
      "id": "",
      "nodes": [],
      "textData": {
       "text": "It also had test switches for something only this game would need: the ",
       "decorations": []
      }
     },
     {
      "type": "TEXT",
      "id": "",
      "nodes": [],
      "textData": {
       "text": "gacha noise",
       "decorations": [
        {
         "type": "BOLD",
         "fontWeightValue": 700
        }
       ]
      }
     },
     {
      "type": "TEXT",
      "id": "",
      "nodes": [],
      "textData": {
       "text": ". Early on the numbers are big and random; later, as the gacha cracks, they become small and exact. The team could flip it on and off to feel the difference.",
       "decorations": []
      }
     }
    ],
    "paragraphData": {}
   },
   {
    "type": "PARAGRAPH",
    "id": "",
    "nodes": [],
    "paragraphData": {}
   },
